===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|hi|psu|𑀆𑀮𑀼𑀕}}, from {{inh|hi|sa|आलुक||elephant foot yam}}. It came to refer to the potato in Hindi after the importation of potatoes to South Asia from the Americas by Europeans, displacing cultivation of the similar elephant foot yam.

